      "q": "8. In a survey of $25$ students, it was found that $15$ had taken mathematics, $12$ had taken physics and $11$ had taken chemistry, $5$ had taken mathematics and chemistry, $9$ had taken mathematics and physics, $4$ had taken physics and chemistry and $3$ had taken all three subjects.\nFind the no. of students that had taken\n(i). only chemistry",
