      "q": "12. The mid points of the sides of $\\vartriangle ABC$ are given by $( - 2,3,5),(4, - 1,7)$ and $(6,5,3)$ find the co-ordinate of ${\\text{A}},{\\text{B}}$ and${\\text{C}}$.",
